{#
  src/ioc-index.njk — the compact search index the browser fetches
  =================================================================
  Emits src/_data/iocIndex.js's `compact` payload as a static JSON file at
  /assets/data/ioc-index.json. This is what src/assets/js/ioc-search.js
  downloads once and searches client-side.

  Deliberately not a layout-wrapped page: no `layout` in the front matter, so
  11ty writes the rendered body verbatim. The one-letter keys and the source
  lookup table are built in iocIndex.js — see compactIndex() there for why.

  The file is also the documented fallback for readers without JavaScript,
  linked from the <noscript> block on /remote-workers/, so its URL is
  public API. Don't move it without updating that link.
#}
